WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.100
Hello, my name is Leanne and we live in

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.250
Chandler, Brisbane.

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:05.620
We engaged with Sabre Constructions

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:07.900
roughly four years ago to do the extension

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:09.820
to our current home and to build the

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:11.210
granny flat on our property.

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:13.220
Since then we've used them for various

00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:16.240
projects on our property, some bigger and

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:18.680
some smaller, and we've recently done a

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:20.660
full roof restoration to the main house

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:21.920
and to the granny flat.

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:23.720
We came across Sabre Constructions when

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:26.560
friends of ours used them to do a full

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:28.320
home reno on an older home that they'd

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:30.980
built in Wellington Point, and we were

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:32.720
very happy with the outcome of their home

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:34.140
and decided to use them.

00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:36.240
For anybody that's had a bad experience

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.500
with a builder, you'll appreciate a good

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:40.160
builder, and that's why we kept coming

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:41.800
back to Sabre Constructions.

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:43.460
We've used them for four years, they've

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:45.240
got a wonderful work ethic, they're

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:46.940
committed to a great end product, they're

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:49.340
reliable and friendly, and their attention

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:51.000
to detail is amazing.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.360
With any renovation or home build that you

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:55.420
do, you are bound to run into problems,

00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:57.540
and to have a company that is committed to

00:00:57.540 --> 00:00:59.640
a wonderful end product and is able to

00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:02.020
step in and foresee any challenges and

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:03.620
work through them to give you a great end

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:05.240
product, that says it all.

00:01:05.240 --> 00:01:07.000
So we will definitely be using Sabre

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.480
Constructions for future work, and we

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:10.500
highly recommend them.
